    website: 'https://climatedrift.com'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/aphilosof/climate-solutions-explorer'
url: 'https://climatesolutionsmap.earth'
abstract: >-
  An interactive platform for exploring climate solutions data
  through five D3.js views (circle packing, dendrogram, treemap,
  sunburst, and a sortable list) with advanced search capabilities
  powered by MiniSearch with boolean operators (AND, OR, NOT) and
  full-text search across all content. The database includes 320+
  curated climate solutions across 12 sectors: Power, Protect
  Nature, Transportation, Water, Food and Agriculture, Circular
  Economy, Industry, Fuels & Chemicals, Buildings, Climate
  Intelligence, Finance, and Carbon Removal.
